    ('角落', '孩子躲在教室的角落里偷偷玩手机。', 'góc', 'jiǎo luò', '孩子躲在教室的角落里偷偷玩手机。', 'góc', 'jiǎo luò', 'Háizi duǒ zài jiàoshì de jiǎoluò lǐ tōutōu wán shǒujī.', 'Đứa trẻ trốn ở góc lớp để chơi điện thoại lén lút.', 'https://ssmqppvkgffknfqdvpwg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/card-audio/templates/hsk6-co-ban/word-0c2285d2b247e789c11227aa.mp3', 'https://ssmqppvkgffknfqdvpwg.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/card-audio/templates/hsk6-co-ban/sentence-168c507c53a15059acf5e774.mp3'),
